$> Transition.fade_in()
$> wait(1)
$> Transition.fade_out(0)
$> play_video("FirstCutscene-1")
$> loop_video("FirstCutscene-2a")
$> wait(1)
What even is today's date? I don't know.
I'm in some kind of forest...
I can't remember what I was doing before, what lead me here...
My minds is all hazy, like I just woke up from a long dream.
And when I look up...
[hide]
