Is this even real? 
Some kind of illusion?
The sky has all these weird lines going across.
[hide]
$> play_video("FirstCutscene-3a")
$> wait(1)
Maybe following the direction of this river will help me find my way.
...
I can't really feel movment in any one direction.
Is this a lake?
[hide]
$> play_video("FirstCutscene-3b")
$> no_nametag()
$> next_box("Mira")
Ew, it's all goopy!
$> next_box("Mira")
There's no way this is drinkable.
[hide]
$> play_video("FirstCutscene-4")
$> wait(1)
My head is still all fuzzy.
[hide]
$> full_screen_picture("MiraSignature")
$> wait(3)
$> picture_clear()
$> play_video("FirstCutscene-5a")
$> wait(1)
Good thing I wrote my name, before I forgot that too...
