$> wait(1)
What should I do now?
Is there even anything I can do?
$> wait(1)
[hide]
$> play_video("FirstCutscene-5c")
$> next_box("Mira")
I really am hopeless.
$> next_box("Mira")
I'll just die alone from thirst in here...
$> wait(2)
