~ daze_introduction
$> add_to_diary("oct31")
I open my eyes and see im somewhere else. Is this a tent?
I get up and look around. My clothes are all ripped and I have a bandage on my left arm.
Ow, it hurts quite a bit to move it around.
$> Party.get_member("Daze").FirstName = ""
Daze.Neutral: Oh Ms. Levenor, you're finally up!
A human..?
I'm not that sure what to say, and I just stare silent for a bit. 
After a bit of hesitation I go to sit on the other side of the campfire.
Mira.Neutral: I have so many questions...
Daze.Neutral: Ask away.
$> add_flag("DazeQuestions", 0)
~ daze_questions
What do I ask?
- Who is he?
	Mira.Neutral: So... who are you?
	Daze.Neutral: The name is Daze.
	$> Party.get_member("Daze").FirstName = "Daze"
	Daze.Neutral: I'm from Elmethin, a city to the north of the Capital, but I've been traveling around for a while now.
	Mira.Neutral: A traveller? Where are you going?
	Daze.Neutral: That's a long story... and doesn't really matter.
	Daze.Neutral: What matters is I was seprated from my comanions while traveling.
	Huh.
	$> add_to_diary("oct31_dazesus")
- Where are we?
	Mira.Neutral: do you have any idea where we are?
	Daze.Neutral: I'm not so sure... I don't remember exactly how I got here.
	Daze.Neutral: However I speculate that this place is disconnected from the outside world.
	Mira.Neutral: Huh?! How so?
	Daze.Neutral: do you remember how you got here? Have you tried walking far away?
	Mira.Neutral: I don't remember much...
	Mira.Neutral: And no, I was just walking through an abandoned town.
	Mira.Neutral: What do you mean?
	Daze.Neutral: It'll be easier to show than tell, hold that thought.
	Huh? What does he want to show me?
	Daze.Neutral: Any other questions?
- How does he know your name?
	Daze.Neutral: Oh, it's because of this.
	=>< get_journal 
- About the monster...
	Mira.Neutral: How did you take on that monster so easily?
	Daze.Neutral: Oh it was already quite weakened, I simply finished it off.
	Mira.Neutral: But you just... cleanly sliced a rock in half. With a sword. Like it's BREAD! How is that even possible?!
	Daze.Neutral: What can I say, I'm just that skilled~
	Daze.Neutral: No, you had weakened its Aura shield quite a bit. 
	Daze.Neutral: Monsters like that are pretty fragile once their control over their physical parts is weakened.
	Daze.Neutral: Anything else?
- About {{alcine}}...
	Mira.Neutral: Did you happen to see something like a water spirit with spirally aura where you found me?
	Daze.Neutral: I apologize, but no. Was it important?
	Mira.Neutral: Quite a bit...
	I should go back and look for them later.
- Ask for some water?
	Mira.Neutral: You got any water?
	Daze.Neutral: Here.
	He brings a bottle of water. I drink it all quickly.
	Mira.Neutral: Do you have any more?
	He gives me another bottle, I also drink it quickly.
	Mira.Neutral: Ahh... I didn't drink anything the whole day yesterday...
	Daze.Neutral: And you were fighting that thing? You need like a week's worth of rest...
	Daze.Neutral: I also got some food packed up. Hold on.
	$> Transition.fade_in()
	He gives me some bread wraps he had. 
	It's nothing special, but not having eated a whole day makes anything taste amazing.
	$> Transition.fade_out()
	Mira.Neutral: Thank you, I was starving...
- Nothing else to ask
	Mira.Neutral: I think that all I had to ask. Thanks.
	if get_flag("DazeQuestions") == 0:
		Daze.Neutral: What is all? You didn't ask anything!
		Mira.Neutral: Oh I didn't, did I?
		Mira.Neutral: Sorry, I forgot what I wanted to ask.
		Daze.Neutral: ...
	if get_flag("DazeQuestions") == 1:
		Daze.Neutral: That was... one question...
		Mira.Neutral: Yeah, that's all I needed.
		Daze.Neutral: Understood...
	if get_flag("DazeQuestions") == 2:
		Daze.Neutral: That was just two question...
		Mira.Neutral: I guess I didn't have as much on my mind as I expected, hehe.
	=> daze_questions_done
$> add_flag("DazeQuestions", get_flag("DazeQuestions") + 1)
=> daze_questions

~ get_journal
He picks up a book next to him... wait that's my journal!
I quickly take it from him.
[hide]
$> add_item("Journal", &"Key")
Mira.Neutral: Hey! Where did you even find this?!
Mira.Neutral: You can't just read people's personal Journals!
Daze.Neutral: I'm sorry. It was the only way I could know who you are, since you were unconscious...
Mira.Neutral: How much did you read!?
Daze.Neutral: Only a few pages, but a lot of the pages also seem to have been ripped out of it.
Mira.Neutral: Wait what? How did that happen?
Daze.Neutral: I don't know, this is how I found it.
It's true, many of the pages seem ripped out.
I should take a closer look later.
=> END

~ daze_questions_done
if not check_item("Journal"):
	Daze.Neutral: By the way, I belive this is yours.
	=>< get_journal
Mira.Neutral: So what's the plan now?
Daze.Neutral: You stay here and rest now. 
Daze.Neutral: I've been wanting to explore this place further, but... let's leave that for tommorow.
Daze.Neutral: I'll go scout around here for monsters.
Daze.Neutral: Just stay here and rest while I'm away, alright?
Mira.Neutral: Alright.
if Party.get_member("Daze").FirstName != "Daze":
	Mira.Neutral: Oh by the way, I didn't ask. What's your name?
	if get_flag("DazeQuestions") < 3:
		Daze.Neutral: Oh, so you did have more things to ask.
	Daze.Neutral: It's Daze.
	$> Party.get_member("Daze").FirstName = "Daze"
	Mira.Neutral: Daze...
	Mira.Neutral: Is that a first or last name?
	Daze.Neutral: It's... more of a nickname.
	Mira.Neutral: Oh, got it.
=> END

